@startuml context-relationships
title Отношения bounded contexts и published language
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "platform-governance" as Platform
rectangle "data-governance" as Governance
rectangle "lead-management" as Leads
rectangle "audience" as Audience
rectangle "content-production" as Content
rectangle "outreach-orchestration" as Outreach
rectangle "message-delivery" as Delivery
rectangle "engagement-observation" as Engagement
rectangle "analytics" as Analytics
rectangle "integration-platform" as Integration
rectangle "request-fulfillment" as Requests

Governance --> Leads : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\ndata-zone-policy
Governance --> Outreach : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\nprocessing-authority
Governance --> Delivery : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\nsuppression-policy
Governance --> Audience : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\ndata-zone-policy
Leads --> Audience : C/S / query\nsync · http-json\nlead-profile
Audience --> Outreach : C/S / query\nsync · http-json\naudience-snapshot
Content --> Outreach : C/S / query\nsync · http-json\ncontent-version
Outreach --> Delivery : PL / command\nsync · http-json\napproved-action
Delivery --> Engagement : PL / event\nasync · amqp\ndelivery-event
Delivery --> Leads : PL / event\nasync · amqp\ndelivery-event
Engagement --> Outreach : PL / event\nasync · amqp\nengagement-event
Engagement --> Audience : PL / event\nasync · amqp\nengagement-event
Outreach --> Analytics : PL / event\nasync · amqp\nanalytics-event
Delivery --> Analytics : PL / event\nasync · amqp\ndelivery-event
Engagement --> Analytics : PL / event\nasync · amqp\nengagement-event
Platform --> Outreach : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\naccess-decision

Integration ..> Leads : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nprovider-port
Integration ..> Leads : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nvector
Integration ..> Content : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nprovider-port
Integration ..> Delivery : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nprovider-port
Integration ..> Outreach : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nprovider-port

Platform --> Requests : PL / policy\nasync · amqp\ntenant-context
Leads --> Requests : C/S / query\nsync · http-json\nlead-profile
Audience --> Requests : C/S / query\nsync · http-json\naudience-snapshot
Outreach --> Requests : PL / query\nsync · http-json\ncampaign-state
Outreach --> Requests : PL / command\nsync · http-json\ncall-intent
Requests --> Platform : PL / command\nsync · http-json\nrequest-intent
Integration ..> Requests : ACL / command\nsync · http-json\nvector

legend bottom
  PL = Published Language
  C/S = Customer / Supplier
  ACL = Anticorruption Layer
  Стрелка направлена от upstream к downstream.
  Транспорт: sync · http-json — command/query; async · amqp — event/policy.
endlegend

' CTX:platform-governance
' CTX:data-governance
' CTX:lead-management
' CTX:audience
' CTX:content-production
' CTX:outreach-orchestration
' CTX:message-delivery
' CTX:engagement-observation
' CTX:analytics
' CTX:integration-platform
' CTX:request-fulfillment
@enduml
